check trackpad size 109.9..110.1 55.9..56.1 0.45..0.55
check lid_shell watertight
check lid_shell parts 1
check lid_shell width 315.5..315.7
check screen_active watertight
check screen_active width 301.6..301.8
check hinge_left watertight
check hinge_right watertight
check trackpoint watertight

